<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- ========================================================================
     Kitchen-sink NodeSet2 for issue #4251.

     This model deliberately flips every knob defined by UANodeSet.xsd so both
     the source-generation pipeline (<AdditionalFiles ModelSourceGeneratorPrefix
     ="Opc.Ua.CoverageTest">) and the runtime import pipeline
     (RuntimeNodeSetNodeManagerFactory / AddRuntimeNodeSet) can be validated
     node-by-node, attribute-by-attribute and reference-by-reference and then
     cross-checked for structural equivalence.

     Every owned node lives in the primary model namespace
     (http://opcfoundation.org/UA/CoverageTest/). A secondary namespace is
     declared so the namespace table carries a cross-namespace entry, and a
     ServerUri feeds server-index-bearing ExpandedNodeIds.

     The concrete NodeId/BrowseName catalogue is duplicated in
     CoverageTestCatalogue.cs and Opc.Ua.CoverageTest.NodeSet2.csv.
     ======================================================================== -->
